From: Project Luma <maintainers@projectluma.org>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 17:45:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] top-panel: make short upward dismissals intentional

The full-height handheld settings surface required 30 percent travel before
Phoc would keep an ordinary drag in the folded state. On the FP6 that makes a
controlled short upward motion visibly follow the finger and then rebound,
unless it also crosses the compositor's high-velocity fling gate.

Keep the compositor-owned interactive drag and its direction/handle rules, but
lower this surface's distance threshold to 18 percent. The change is local to
Quick Options: application scrolling, lockscreen swipes and other draggable
surfaces retain their existing thresholds.

---
--- a/src/top-panel.c
+++ b/src/top-panel.c
@@ -42,7 +42,7 @@
 #define CUSTOM_STATUS_ICONS_SCHEMA "mobi.phosh.shell.plugins"
 #define CUSTOM_STATUS_ICONS_KEY "status-icons"
 
-#define PHOSH_TOP_PANEL_DRAG_THRESHOLD 0.3
+#define PHOSH_TOP_PANEL_DRAG_THRESHOLD 0.18
 
 /**
  * PhoshTopPanel:
-- 
2.53.0
